	(footprint "FaderBoard:Fader_Slide_Dual_75mm_60mmTravel_B103"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "574958e1-0a19-4977-80fd-bffae6333a29")
		(at 155.25 81.75 90)
		(descr "GROUND TRUTH = EasyEDA user footprint 75mm Behringer mixer fader B10K double straight slide potentiometer B103 (uuid 4aa3271656a045778c8dc1cd9fa153a7), converted 1:1 (10 mil = 0.254 mm, origin = silk body centre). Dual 10k slide pot, 75 x 9 mm body, 60 mm travel. Pins: 4 at one end on a ~2.5 mm pitch (2A wiper A, 1A track end A, 2B wiper B, 1B track end B, contributor labels F1/RAW/F2/RAW), 2 at the other end 5 mm apart (3A, 3B, contributor label GND). Pin group spacing 70.04 mm end to end. Two NPTH mounting holes d2.03 at 44.5 mm spacing. Pad 1.524 round / 0.914 drill (source values). VERIFY gang A/B and end/wiper with a meter; the names follow the contributor labels only.")
